# The application reads its configuration from Server/.env (git-ignored).
# Copy the template and fill in real values:
#     cp Server/.env.example Server/.env
#
# See Server/.env.example for the full list of variables (DB_HOST, DB_PORT,
# DB_NAME, DB_USER, DB_PASSWORD, optional Jwt__Secret / Smtp__Password).
# On the Ubuntu/production server, set these as real environment variables
# instead of committing a file.
